coach "Adaptive"
about "Keeps calling whatever is working, drops what isn't, and defends what the other side keeps doing."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when fourth down and to go under 2 and past midfield -> call "QB Sneak" or "Power"
  when fourth down and to go over 6 -> call "Four Verticals" or "Smash" or "Mesh"
  when fourth down -> call "Slants" or "Inside Zone" or "Curl Flat"
  when "Mesh" averaging over 7 and chance 50% -> call "Mesh"
  when "Smash" averaging over 7 and chance 50% -> call "Smash"
  when "Four Verticals" averaging over 9 and chance 50% -> call "Four Verticals"
  when "Power" averaging over 5 and chance 50% -> call "Power"
  when "Inside Zone" averaging over 5 and chance 50% -> call "Inside Zone"
  when third down and to go over 6 -> call "Smash" or "Mesh" or "Four Verticals"
  when running averaging under 3 -> call "Slants" or "Mesh" or "Curl Flat" or "Smash"
  when passing averaging under 4 -> call "Inside Zone" or "Power" or "Draw"
  otherwise -> call "Inside Zone" or "Power" or "Slants" or "Mesh" or "Smash" or "Curl Flat"

defense:
  when they run over 60% -> call "Run Blitz" or "Cover 1"
  when they pass over 60% and third down -> call "Cover 2" or "Cover 3"
  when they pass over 60% -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 0 Blitz" or "Cover 3"
  when "Cover 3" averaging under 3 and chance 50% -> call "Cover 3"
  when "Cover 1" averaging under 3 and chance 50% -> call "Cover 1"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 3" or "Cover 2" or "Cover 1"

lineup:
  QB "Pocket Passer"
  RB "Patient Runner"
  WR "Route Runner"
  TE "Receiving TE"
  OL "Pass Protector"
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Center Fielder"
